#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:198
#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:231
#: includes/class-admin-form-tabs-renderer.php:163
#: includes/class-admin-page-renderer.php:55
msgid "Normal"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:199
#: includes/class-admin-form-tabs-renderer.php:163
msgid "Spacious"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:204
msgid ""
"What it does: Sets inner form spacing (line height, field gaps, padding). "
"Compact = less scrolling; Spacious = more comfortable touch use. If "
"“Density” is set on the product card, that product overrides this setting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:206
msgid "Glass blur (px)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:208
msgid ""
"What it does: The “frosted glass” blur strength of the popup background. 0 = "
"no blur (flat panel). Higher values = softer and heavier (performance cost "
"may increase). Visual effect may be limited because the popup background is "
"currently forced to flat white; it is meaningful together with Soft Glass "
"packs."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:210
msgid "Glass fill opacity (%)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:212
msgid ""
"What it does: How opaque or transparent the popup surface is. 100 = fully "
"opaque white; 60–80 = a glass effect where the page behind shows through "
"slightly. 85+ is recommended for readability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:214
msgid "Elevation (1–5)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:216
msgid ""
"What it does: Popup and card shadow depth. 1 = flat/minimal; 5 = a clearly "
"raised shadow. Sets the “floating” feel without changing the brand hue."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:218
msgid "Overlay color"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:220
msgid ""
"What it does: The dimmer color that darkens the background when the popup "
"opens. Usually a dark navy/black; a dark tone close to the brand also works."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:222
msgid "Overlay opacity (%)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:224
msgid ""
"What it does: How dark the dimmer is. Low = the background stays readable; "
"high = more focus on the form, darker background. Typical range 40–60."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:226
msgid "Form font stack"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:227
msgid "inherit or 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:228
msgid ""
"What it does: The typeface family inside the popup/form. “inherit” = use "
"your theme’s font. For a custom font, write a CSS font-family (not a Google "
"Fonts URL). E.g. 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif — the font must already be "
"loaded in the theme or on the page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:230
msgid "Motion"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:231
msgid "Subtle"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:231
msgid "Expressive"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:232
msgid ""
"What it does: Sets the strength of animations such as open and success. "
"Subtle = calmer sites; Expressive = livelier transitions. Animations are "
"already reduced for users with “prefers-reduced-motion” on."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:234
msgid "Quick amount button style"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:235
msgid "Soft"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:235
msgid "Outline"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:235
msgid "Solid"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:236
msgid ""
"What it does: How quick amount options (100 / 250 / 500…) look. Soft = light "
"fill; Outline = border only; Solid = a button filled with the brand color. "
"If quick amount buttons are off (product/general setting), this setting is "
"hidden."
